{
  "file" : "npc/cities/gonryun.txt",
  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 21,
      "text" : "[Wa Bai Hu]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 22,
      "text" : "Good day~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 23,
      "text" : "Let me invite you all"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 24,
      "text" : "to my homeland, Kunlun."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 25,
      "text" : "It is my honor to guide"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 26,
      "text" : "such distinguished quests from"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 27,
      "text" : "the Rune-Midgarts kingdom."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 29,
      "text" : "About Kunlun"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 29,
      "text" : "Visit Kunlun"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 29,
      "text" : "Cancel"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "text" : "[Wa Bai Hu]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 32,
      "text" : "Kunlun is a beautiful place,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 33,
      "text" : "rich with history, and its"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 34,
      "text" : "own traditions. I also think"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 35,
      "text" : "Kunlun is the best place for"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 36,
      "text" : "sightseeing."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "text" : "[Wa Bai Hu]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 39,
      "text" : "When you arrive at the harbor of"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "text" : "Kunlun, you'll be able to see"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "text" : "miniature replicas of"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "text" : "buildings found in Alberta"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 43,
      "text" : "and Prontera."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "text" : "[Wa Bai Hu]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "text" : "After enjoying a nice, leisurely"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 47,
      "text" : "stroll, step into the beautiful"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "text" : "column of light that will take"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "text" : "you up into the clouds to"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "text" : "Kunlun Village."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "text" : "[Wa Bai Hu]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 53,
      "text" : "I've heard that on the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 54,
      "text" : "Rune-Midgarts continent,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "text" : "there is another city that is"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "text" : "is kept aloft in the sky by"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "text" : "an ancient, mysterious power..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "text" : "[Wa Bai Hu]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 60,
      "text" : "Well, my Kunlun also floats"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 61,
      "text" : "in the air, but without any"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "text" : "so called technology or"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "text" : "power supply. We consider"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 64,
      "text" : "our land especially blessed..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "text" : "[Wa Bai Hu]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 67,
      "text" : "When you're in Kunlun, don't"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "text" : "forget to try our specialties"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "text" : "such as the giant dumpling or the heaven peach."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "text" : "[Wa Bai Hu]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 72,
      "text" : "You'd better prepare yourself"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 73,
      "text" : "if you are planning to visit"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 74,
      "text" : "the Kunlun dungeon. I must"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "text" : "say, that is not a safe place to go for fun."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 77,
      "text" : "[Wa Bai Hu]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 78,
      "text" : "If you are interested in visiting"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "text" : "Kunlun, do not hesitate to let"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "text" : "me know. It's my great pleasure"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "text" : "to serve you, honorable guest."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 84,
      "text" : "[Wa Bai Hu]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 85,
      "text" : "Excellent choice, I am glad"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "text" : "to have you as our guest~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 87,
      "text" : "However, a small fee is required"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 88,
      "text" : "to board the ship to Kunlun."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "text" : "[Wa Bai Hu]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "text" : "We ask that you pay 10,000 zeny"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 92,
      "text" : "prior to departure. That fee also"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 93,
      "text" : "covers the cost of returning"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 94,
      "text" : "to Alberta. I am ready to guide"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 95,
      "text" : "you to Kunlun at any time."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "text" : "[Wa Bai Hu]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "text" : "Would you like to board?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 100,
      "text" : "To Kunlun~!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 100,
      "text" : "No."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 102,
      "text" : "[Wa Bai Hu]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 103,
      "text" : "Thank you, let me guide you there immediately."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 109,
      "text" : "[Wa Bai Hu]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "text" : "I am sorry, but you must have"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "text" : "10,000 zeny to travel to Kunlun."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 112,
      "text" : "Please make sure you have enough"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 113,
      "text" : "zeny with you. Thank you, and"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "text" : "please come again."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 117,
      "text" : "[Wa Bai Hu]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 118,
      "text" : "I see. However, whenever you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 119,
      "text" : "change your mind, please let"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "text" : "me know. It would be a great"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 121,
      "text" : "please to serve you, most"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 122,
      "text" : "honorable guest."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 125,
      "text" : "[Wa Bai Hu]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 126,
      "text" : "I see. However, whenever you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 127,
      "text" : "change your mind, please let me"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 128,
      "text" : "know. It would be a great pleasure to serve you, most honorable guest."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 134,
      "npc" : "Kunlun Envoy",
      "text" : "[Wa Bai Hu]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 135,
      "npc" : "Kunlun Envoy",
      "text" : "So, did you enjoy your trip?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 136,
      "npc" : "Kunlun Envoy",
      "text" : "I guess it's the time for you to"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 137,
      "npc" : "Kunlun Envoy",
      "text" : "go home. The ship to Rune-Midgarts is ready to depart at any time."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 139,
      "npc" : "Kunlun Envoy",
      "text" : "Go back to Alberta"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 139,
      "npc" : "Kunlun Envoy",
      "text" : "Cancel"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 140,
      "npc" : "Kunlun Envoy",
      "text" : "[Wa Bai Hu]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 141,
      "npc" : "Kunlun Envoy",
      "text" : "Please come again."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 142,
      "npc" : "Kunlun Envoy",
      "text" : "I hope you will let your friends"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 143,
      "npc" : "Kunlun Envoy",
      "text" : "know about Kunlun when you get"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 144,
      "npc" : "Kunlun Envoy",
      "text" : "back. Now, let me guide you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 145,
      "npc" : "Kunlun Envoy",
      "text" : "back to Alberta."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 153,
      "npc" : "Kunlun Envoy",
      "text" : "[Wa Bai Hu]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 154,
      "npc" : "Kunlun Envoy",
      "text" : "Take your time, my guest."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 155,
      "npc" : "Kunlun Envoy",
      "text" : "There should be many places"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 156,
      "npc" : "Kunlun Envoy",
      "text" : "you may have missed."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 161,
      "npc" : "Kunlun Envoy",
      "text" : "[Zhang Quing Long]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 162,
      "npc" : "Kunlun Envoy",
      "text" : "Please head north to enter Kunlun."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 163,
      "npc" : "Kunlun Envoy",
      "text" : "I hope you will have a great time"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 164,
      "npc" : "Kunlun Envoy",
      "text" : "while staying in Kunlun."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 169,
      "npc" : "Kunlun Envoy",
      "text" : "[Zhang Quing Long]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 170,
      "npc" : "Kunlun Envoy",
      "text" : "Please make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 171,
      "npc" : "Kunlun Envoy",
      "text" : "If you want to go back, I will"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 172,
      "npc" : "Kunlun Envoy",
      "text" : "be more than happy to guide you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 173,
      "npc" : "Kunlun Envoy",
      "text" : "to the ship to Alberta."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 175,
      "npc" : "Kunlun Envoy",
      "text" : "Go back to the harbor"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 175,
      "npc" : "Kunlun Envoy",
      "text" : "Cancel"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 176,
      "npc" : "Kunlun Envoy",
      "text" : "[Zhang Quing Long]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 177,
      "npc" : "Kunlun Envoy",
      "text" : "I hope you enjoyed your trip."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 178,
      "npc" : "Kunlun Envoy",
      "text" : "Now, let me guide you back"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 179,
      "npc" : "Kunlun Envoy",
      "text" : "to the harbor."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 184,
      "npc" : "Kunlun Envoy",
      "text" : "[Zhang Quing Long]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 185,
      "npc" : "Kunlun Envoy",
      "text" : "Take your time, my guest."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 186,
      "npc" : "Kunlun Envoy",
      "text" : "There should be many places"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 187,
      "npc" : "Kunlun Envoy",
      "text" : "you may have missed."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 194,
      "npc" : "Jian Chung Xun",
      "text" : "[Jian Chung Xun]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 195,
      "npc" : "Jian Chung Xun",
      "text" : "I simply adore festivals."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 196,
      "npc" : "Jian Chung Xun",
      "text" : "That's why I love this town."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 197,
      "npc" : "Jian Chung Xun",
      "text" : "This town makes me feel like I am"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 198,
      "npc" : "Jian Chung Xun",
      "text" : "in the middle of a festival all year round."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 203,
      "npc" : "Liang Zhun Bu",
      "text" : "[Liang Zhun Bu]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 204,
      "npc" : "Liang Zhun Bu",
      "text" : "We are proud to be an independent"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 205,
      "npc" : "Liang Zhun Bu",
      "text" : "nation, and have been fighting"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 206,
      "npc" : "Liang Zhun Bu",
      "text" : "against the evil invaders who've"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 207,
      "npc" : "Liang Zhun Bu",
      "text" : "wanted to conquer this blessed land for many years..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 209,
      "npc" : "Liang Zhun Bu",
      "text" : "[Liang Zhun Bu]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 210,
      "npc" : "Liang Zhun Bu",
      "text" : "But we have victoriously fended"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 211,
      "npc" : "Liang Zhun Bu",
      "text" : "off every invasion! As long"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 212,
      "npc" : "Liang Zhun Bu",
      "text" : "as we believe in ourselves,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 213,
      "npc" : "Liang Zhun Bu",
      "text" : "we shall never forget the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 214,
      "npc" : "Liang Zhun Bu",
      "text" : "Triumphal Song that has helped us in our struggles."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 219,
      "npc" : "Qian Yuen Shuang",
      "text" : "[Qian Yuen Shuang]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 220,
      "npc" : "Qian Yuen Shuang",
      "text" : "The chief of this town is a man"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 221,
      "npc" : "Qian Yuen Shuang",
      "text" : "who opens his heart to others."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 222,
      "npc" : "Qian Yuen Shuang",
      "text" : "However, I have heard that there"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 223,
      "npc" : "Qian Yuen Shuang",
      "text" : "are some people who don't like his personality..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 225,
      "npc" : "Qian Yuen Shuang",
      "text" : "[Qian Yuen Shuang]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 226,
      "npc" : "Qian Yuen Shuang",
      "text" : "Well, I like my town. The Chief's"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 227,
      "npc" : "Qian Yuen Shuang",
      "text" : "efforts have made our town safer."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 228,
      "npc" : "Qian Yuen Shuang",
      "text" : "I just hope other people feel the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 229,
      "npc" : "Qian Yuen Shuang",
      "text" : "same way about what he has done."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 234,
      "npc" : "Jing Wen Zhen",
      "text" : "[Jing Wen Zhen]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 235,
      "npc" : "Jing Wen Zhen",
      "text" : "The men in our town, Kunlun, are"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 236,
      "npc" : "Jing Wen Zhen",
      "text" : "all brave and courageous."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 237,
      "npc" : "Jing Wen Zhen",
      "text" : "But, they are unable to get"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 238,
      "npc" : "Jing Wen Zhen",
      "text" : "married. It's quite a shame really..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 240,
      "npc" : "Jing Wen Zhen",
      "text" : "[Jing Wen Zhen]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 241,
      "npc" : "Jing Wen Zhen",
      "text" : "It's all because there are"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 242,
      "npc" : "Jing Wen Zhen",
      "text" : "more men than women."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 243,
      "npc" : "Jing Wen Zhen",
      "text" : "I am not even sure whether"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 244,
      "npc" : "Jing Wen Zhen",
      "text" : "or not my son will be able to"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 245,
      "npc" : "Jing Wen Zhen",
      "text" : "find me a daughter in law."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 250,
      "npc" : "Gatekeeper",
      "text" : "[Kunlun Guard]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 251,
      "npc" : "Gatekeeper",
      "text" : "Welcome."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 252,
      "npc" : "Gatekeeper",
      "text" : "This is the residence of Shi Yan Wen, the chief of Kunlun."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 254,
      "npc" : "Gatekeeper",
      "text" : "[Kunlun Guard]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 255,
      "npc" : "Gatekeeper",
      "text" : "You better behave yourself while"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 256,
      "npc" : "Gatekeeper",
